&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute thoughtful account plans,prioritizing where to invest your time and forecasting performance with a high degree of accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate complex, multi-stakeholder deals, bringing together C-level leaders, IT, central buying teams, and the right internal partners—from Solution Engineering to Legal and Implementation—to move opportunities forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic partner to your customers: understand their most important business priorities and help them see how Airtable can solve problems and create value in ways they may not have considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
