&lt;li&gt;You’re an adaptable seller. You’re comfortable moving across industries, use cases, and buyer personas, and know how to tailor your approach to each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build long-term, trusted relationships with senior leaders. You have the executive presence to influence a room, create alignment across stakeholders, and become a credible partner to your customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re consultative and resourceful. You’re comfortable navigating ambiguity, finding creative paths through complex accounts, and continuously sharpening your approach as you learn.&lt;/li&gt;
